          "caption": "Inscribed stone at Davy Crockett Birthplace State Park in Greene County, Tennessee, in the southeastern United States.  The stone is believed to have been the footstone to the original cabin where Crockett was born in 1786.  The stone was probably inscribed in the late 1880s.  The inscripton reads:\n\n\nON THIS SPOT\nDAVY CROCKETT\nWAS BORN\nAUG 17 1786",
